React 
react is a open source javascript library used to build responsive
single page applications

Features
1. component based architecture
   Navbar Header Card Details Payment Cart
2. Virtual Dom
   It is a copy of real dom
   it will compare the changes with the copy and reflec the changes
   this entire process is called reconcialation  using diffing algorithm
3. Single Page Application
   it contains only one index.html file


